# neegde-tauri — Project Knowledge

## Stack

- **Frontend**: Vue 3 (Composition API, `<script setup>`), plain JavaScript (no TypeScript), Vite 6
- **Desktop shell**: Tauri 2 (Rust backend — `src-tauri/`)
- **Audio**: Web Audio API (equalizer graph), BitTorrent streaming via librqbit (Rust), MediaSession API
- **No router**: hash `#/app-debug` в `main.js` только для debug-окна
- **No state manager**: весь state — `ref`/`shallowRef`/`computed` в `App.vue`

